WEBVTT

00:04:59.422 --> 00:05:00.707
you see the same practice.

00:05:00.731 --> 00:05:03.366
We had a tragic case of an honor killing

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:06.537
within Turkey's Armenian community
just a few months ago.

00:05:06.561 --> 00:05:08.684
Now, these are things
about general culture,

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:11.558
but I'm also very much
interested in political culture

00:05:11.582 --> 00:05:14.399
and whether liberty
and democracy is appreciated,

00:05:14.423 --> 00:05:17.195
or whether there's an authoritarian
political culture

00:05:17.219 --> 00:05:20.440
in which the state is supposed
to impose things on the citizens.

00:05:20.923 --> 00:05:22.631
And it is no secret

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:25.182
that many Islamic movements
in the Middle East

00:05:25.206 --> 00:05:26.483
tend to be authoritarian,

00:05:26.507 --> 00:05:29.438
and some of the so-called
"Islamic regimes,"

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:34.359
such as Saudi Arabia, Iran and the worst
case, the Taliban in Afghanistan,